      "translation": "在一個陽光明媚的早晨，Ethan 背著書包在公車站牌旁等車。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He checks the "
        },
        {
          "text": "bus",
          "wordIds": [
            "bus"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " number and says happily, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Here comes the ",
